Call me old-fashioned, but I appreciate the Dev Team's efforts to keep nethack
in the spirit of D&D, Tolkien, etc.  I imagine the dungeon as an ancient world
in which things were quite different than they are now.  The introduction of
modern technology could completely change, and possibly ruin, the feel of the
game (those expensive cameras are a step down the slippery slope!).  I would
love to see a NEW futuristic game with laser weapons, smart missles, 
thermonuclear devices, and so on, but lets keep this stuff out of the dungeon.
(A year ago or so, some posts suggested adding the ability to teleport into
different time periods, which might be cool for player who want that option.)

